{
  "bodyHash": "KOMum0q9BfQ=",
  "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace\">用最漂亮的垃圾桶丢掉你的物品——<em>前所未有。</em></span>&nbsp;</h4><h4><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/trash-it/blob/1.20.1/resources/trash_can_banner.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Draylar/trash-it/raw/1.20.1/resources/trash_can_banner.png\" alt=\"trash_can_banner.png\"></a></h4><p>厌倦了那些永远处理不掉的钻石？为什么不把它们扔进垃圾桶？而且不是普通的垃圾桶——是一个<em>时尚</em>的垃圾桶，让你的朋友们都羡慕不已！这款垃圾桶提供100%满意保证：如果你对产品不完全满意，你可以把它扔进岩浆湖里，然后改用那个岩浆湖当垃圾桶！</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/trash-it/blob/1.20.1/resources/trash_can.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Draylar/trash-it/raw/1.20.1/resources/trash_can.png\" alt=\"trash_can.png\"></a></p><p>它甚至能与漏斗配合使用！现在你可以用这个高科技方案自动化销毁你最珍贵的物品。</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/trash-it/blob/1.20.1/resources/hopper.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Draylar/trash-it/raw/1.20.1/resources/hopper.png\" alt=\"hopper.png\"></a></p><p>还没心动？看完<em>这个</em>合成配方再想想。</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/trash-it/blob/1.20.1/resources/crafting_image.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Draylar/trash-it/raw/1.20.1/resources/crafting_image.png\" alt=\"crafting_image.png\"></a></p><hr>",
